_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9732277/uploads/origins/2e14dd5c-682d-48eb-95b7-6a882a3b0bd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0069144907431ef97e7ac879428495e5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d9732277/uploads/origins/2e14dd5c-682d-48eb-95b7-6a882a3b0bd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0069144907431ef97e7ac879428495e5, https://si.imgix.net/d9732277/uploads/origins/2e14dd5c-682d-48eb-95b7-6a882a3b0bd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45be6835a320cee741f39c8466111de5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d9732277/uploads/origins/2e14dd5c-682d-48eb-95b7-6a882a3b0bd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2c102a42efb4cb80bd91fbf269e8f347 3x"}, "body": "東みやこさま、突然のリクエスト失礼します。\nYouTubeに歌ってみたを投稿しながら、ゲーム配信や歌枠などを中心に活動している\nしろくまバーチャルライバーの白花百々と申します。\n東みやこさまの描かれる絵の雰囲気が本当に大好きで\n是非私を描いていただきたく今回初めてSkebを利用しました！\n是非宜しくお願い致します。\n\n【リクエストの内容】\n私、Vライバー白花百々のイラストを描いていただきたいです。\n参考資料URLから立ち絵をDLしていただけます。\n又Twitterの固定にも立ち絵がございます。→@shirahana_momo\n\n【イメージや構図】\n梅雨の時期が近いので、「水も滴るいい女」をコンセプトに描いていただきたいです。\n構図、服装、サイズ等お任せしたいです！髪型は前髪ぱっつんはそのままで、後はアレンジしていただいて大丈夫です。\n東みやこさまの描いてみたい私を描いていただけると嬉しいです。\n\n【使用用途】\nTwitter：ヘッダーやアイコン、ツイート(おはVや宣伝ツイート等)での使用\nYouTube：サムネイルやヘッダーへの使用\n活動に関係する場面で多く使用させていただきたいと思っていますので\n人物を透過でもいただけると嬉しいです。\n\n【その他】\n完成の際、　#百々あーと　を付けてい投稿してただけると嬉しいです。\n\n上記内容でも大丈夫でしたら\nぜひ宜しくお願い致します。\n\n白花百々\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1N4ZMJ6c38ctcQulRV-AnqwZPCsWnBv5R/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@azuma_385/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 659763, "client_id": 1717745, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15b9b17bcbd18571e38940d232af46f1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15b9b17bcbd18571e38940d232af46f1, https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e82e160f3258731dfc0f541a05088a7e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a2aec7009216c5b02599dca4552e89d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a65d035de625e4c93d86bc0bc7cc666d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a65d035de625e4c93d86bc0bc7cc666d, https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f8ef10fa21c15f4e314b9cb6f013f793 2x, https://si.imgix.net/743c77c3/uploads/origins/a8662002-b7ba-4df5-b19e-8f5f6a983121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fbb558ba3c6bf604fcdcf09d343db894 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your art style and would like to make a request!\n\nI would like for the following two characters to be in the illustration. Their names are Nozo and Saturn.\n\nSaturn has a ring and small moons orbiting her head, as well as a few sparkling starts. She wears a pair of round glasses with black frames and she is 170cm tall for reference.\nhttps://imgur.com/a/LOjFzy2\n\nNozo is very short, has pure white skin and her eyes slightly glow. She also has a red heart on her left cheek and wears black lipstick. I would like for the heart to be clearly visible if possible. She also wears a pair of red under-rim glasses and is 152cm tall for reference. Please note that I only have one image of her so I hope these screenshots from the game she is from will suffice!\nhttps://imgur.com/a/YId3LyZ\n\nI would like for them to be standing next to each other, Saturn will staring down at Nozo with a curious look on her face. While Nozo is looking up at the Saturn's moons and ring in awe. Thank you!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@azuma_385/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 659763, "client_id": 1150506, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f6e823/uploads/origins/6e30471a-f3b5-4cd2-b618-a46b17e3e0d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57ff1577606dde52096ccb1748d65bc1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f6e823/uploads/origins/6e30471a-f3b5-4cd2-b618-a46b17e3e0d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57ff1577606dde52096ccb1748d65bc1, https://si.imgix.net/e1f6e823/uploads/origins/6e30471a-f3b5-4cd2-b618-a46b17e3e0d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=535c77f5d5c875579884b5d1d454948c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e1f6e823/uploads/origins/6e30471a-f3b5-4cd2-b618-a46b17e3e0d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42f973a9d07a9a434b661bd61c26310c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f6e823/uploads/origins/6e30471a-f3b5-4cd2-b618-a46b17e3e0d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3a38d74a3938f483e9622f1ebc7fad94"